SUMMARY:Live Music and Food Truck
DESCRIPTION:Live Music & Food Truck Friday in Davis Friday\, October 2 | 5–8:30 PM\nKick off your weekend with award-winning wine\, live classic rock & blues\, delicious Cajun food\, and a beautiful vineyard setting! \nGrab your friends\, grab a glass of wine\, and settle in for a relaxing Friday night at Great Bear Vineyards. Enjoy the vineyard views\, soak up the music\, and let the weekend begin! \n LIVE MUSIC | DNA Mechanics | 6–7:30 PMGet ready to turn up the tunes with DNA Mechanics\, bringing live classic rock & blues to the vineyard.  Their energetic set is the perfect soundtrack for sipping wine\, enjoying dinner\, and maybe getting up for a little dancing!\n FOOD | Soul Ona Roll | 5–8:30 PMCome hungry! Soul Ona Roll will be serving up delicious Cajun classics\, including their famous Voodoo Fries.  Pair them with a glass of wine and you’ve got yourself one seriously tasty Friday night.\n TICKET INCLUDES: One glass of wine Live music An evening at the vineyard\nBring your crew\, your appetite\, and your Friday-night energy! Good wine + great music + Cajun comfort food = a pretty perfect way to start the weekend. \nPlease note: Food is available for purchase from Soul Ona Roll. To support our local food truck partner\, please do not bring outside food.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/live-music-and-food-truck-29/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards  24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Great-Bear-Vineyards_23GBV-drone-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
