SUMMARY:Homemade Gnocchi and Squash Cooking Class
DESCRIPTION:Homemade Gnocchi & Squash Cooking Class in Davis Saturday\, October 3 | 11am\nGet ready to roll up your sleeves and cook up something delicious! Join us at Great Bear Vineyards for a hands-on\, plant-based cooking class celebrating the warm\, comforting flavors of the season. \nLearn how to make soft\, pillowy vegan gnocchi from scratch\, paired with a rich mushroom and seasonal squash sauce. Along the way\, you’ll pick up practical kitchen skills and plenty of tips for creating flavorful\, restaurant-worthy plant-based meals at home.\n In This Hands-On Class\, You’ll Learn: How to make fresh gnocchi from scratch How to select and cook seasonal vegetables How to create a flavorful squash & mushroom sauce Essential knife and ingredient-prep techniques Tips for building a balanced\, delicious plant-based meal\n On the Menu:\n Massaged Kale SaladFresh kale with cherry tomatoes\, red onion\, dried cranberries\, and vegan Parmesan\, tossed in a light dressing.\n Handmade Gnocchi with Seasonal Squash & Mushroom SaucePillowy homemade potato gnocchi served with roasted seasonal squash in a savory mushroom sauce\, finished with fresh herbs and vegan Parmesan. \nWhether you’re new to cooking or already love spending time in the kitchen\, this class is a fun way to learn new skills\, enjoy seasonal ingredients\, and discover just how delicious plant-based cooking can be!\n Ticket Includes: Cooking Class All ingredients Equipment A glass of Great Bear wine\nCome hungry\, get hands-on\, and leave with new skills and plenty of inspiration for your next dinner party!
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/homemade-gnocchi-and-squash-cooking-class/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards  24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Great-Bear-Vineyards_23GBV-drone-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
