SUMMARY:National Mead Day Celebration at The HIVE
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate National Mead Day with some of our local mead makers! Learn about each mead makers process and inspiration\, right from the source. Enjoy FREE mead samples\, take advantage of one day only bottle discounts and mead-inspired specials from Chef Diego! \n20% Off 3+ Select Bottles and 4-packs. This is a FREE event.
