SUMMARY:Open Farm Day in Capay Valley
DESCRIPTION:A DAY ON THE FARM\, CELEBRATING THE PEOPLE WHO GROW OUR FOOD \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHosted at multiple farm locations throughout the Capay Valley\, Open Farm Day brings farmers and visitors together for a day of exploration\, learning\, and celebration. This hands-on event is perfect for families\, food lovers\, agricultural learners\, and anyone curious about where their food comes from. \n\n\nUnlike a single-venue festival\, this event invites you into the fields\, orchards\, and barns of real working farms — giving you a firsthand look at growing practices\, seasonal rhythms\, and the people behind your food. \nEach participating farm offers something special. You might find: \n\n\nOrchard tours and crop demonstrations \n\n\nFarm animals and kid-friendly activities \n\n\nHands-on workshops and tastings \n\n\nFarmer Q&A sessions and interactive learning \n\n\nFarmstands stocked with fresh produce and local products \n\n\nIt’s an event designed to deepen understanding\, inspire curiosity\, and spark meaningful connections between visitors and the agricultural community.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/open-farm-day-in-capay-valley/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/VY-Capay-Valley-Hills-25.jpg
END:VEVENT
